      "statement": "`ended` 事件的分支选择是：`isLoopMode` 为真时把 `currentTime` 归零、保持 `pPlayIntent = true` 并 `tryPlay('loop')`；否则在 `playModeSelect.value !== 'stop-after'` 时先 `pOpenTransition(from, to)` 再 `playNext()`，让后续由 `timeupdate` 或看门狗裁定转场成败。",
      "evidence": [
